    "id": "voa-sh-voanews-com-a-the-blue-hotel-by-stephen-crane-part-three-4773659-html",
    "title": "'The Blue Hotel,' by Stephen Crane, Part Three",
    "deck": "We present the third of four parts of the short story \"The Blue Hotel,\" by Stephen Crane.",
    "source": "VOA Learning English",
    "sourceId": "voa",
    "sourceUrl": "https://learningenglish.voanews.com/a/the-blue-hotel-by-stephen-crane-part-three/4773659.html",
