    "license": "VOA-produced Learning English text is public domain with credit; third-party wire material is not imported.",
    "attribution": "Text: VOA Learning English",
    "contentNote": "官方自製文章全文已轉為純文字，未複製音訊、圖片或第三方通訊社材料。",
    "minutes": 9,
