    "id": "nasa-ransfer-spinoffs-nasas-life-saving-technology-where-cell-signals-cant-go",
    "title": "NASA’s Life-Saving Technology Where Cell Signals Can’t Go",
    "deck": "Search and rescue technology developed in part by NASA saved five lives",
    "source": "NASA",
    "sourceId": "nasa",
    "sourceUrl": "https://www.nasa.gov/technology/tech-transfer-spinoffs/nasas-life-saving-technology-where-cell-signals-cant-go/",
    "sourceFeed": "https://www.nasa.gov/technology/feed/",
    "category": "科學",
    "topic": "Technology Transfer & Spinoffs · Research and Technology Mission Directorate",
    "publishedAt": "2026-09-10",
    "license": "NASA material is generally not copyrighted in the United States; marked third-party material is excluded.",
    "attribution": "Text: NASA",
    "contentNote": "只匯入 NASA 官方頁面的純文字正文；圖片、標誌、下載附件與標示的第三方材料均不在 App 內。",
    "minutes": 3,
