    "id": "standard-standardebooks-org-ebooks-anna-katharine-green-hand-and-ring",
    "title": "Hand and Ring",
    "deck": "Anna Katharine Green — Detectives are baffled when a conversation about how to commit the perfect murder is followed within minutes by exactly such a murder.",
    "source": "Standard Ebooks",
    "sourceId": "standard-ebooks",
